<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">

    <meta name="viewport"
          content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Enquiry Sent Successfully | Brothers Light</title>

    <style>

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f8f8f8;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .success-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 550px;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 50px 35px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        .success-icon {
            width: 85px;
            height: 85px;
            margin: 0 auto 25px;

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;

            border-radius: 50%;

            background: #990011;
            color: #ffffff;

            font-size: 45px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: #222222;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #666666;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .email-note {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #777777;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .home-button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 13px 28px;

            background: #990011;
            color: #ffffff;

            text-decoration: none;

            border-radius: 7px;

            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;

            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .home-button:hover {
            background: #7d000e;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {

            .success-container {
                padding: 40px 22px;
            }

            .success-icon {
                width: 70px;
                height: 70px;
                font-size: 36px;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 26px;
            }

            p {
                font-size: 15px;
            }

        }

    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="success-container">

        <div class="success-icon">
            ✓
        </div>

        <h1>
            Enquiry Sent Successfully!
        </h1>

        <p>
            Thank you for contacting
            <strong>Brothers Light</strong>.
        </p>

        <p>
            We have received your enquiry successfully.
            Our team will review your requirements and
            contact you shortly.
        </p>

        <div class="email-note">
            A confirmation email has also been sent to your email address.
        </div>

        <a href="/" class="home-button">
            Back to Home
        </a>

    </div>

</body>

</html>